      "places": [
        "POST /index.php/apps/kinship/api/v1/families  kinship.family.create  appinfo/routes.php:5 routes: OCA\\Kinship\\Controller\\FamilyController has no method create()"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "1 route names a controller class or a method that does not exist, or a method that is not public. A request to such a route ends in an error.",
        "  POST /index.php/apps/kinship/api/v1/families  kinship.family.create  appinfo/routes.php:5 routes: OCA\\Kinship\\Controller\\FamilyController has no method create()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "route-duplicate",
      "level": "warn",
      "places": [
        "kinship.page.index: kinship.page.index at appinfo/routes.php:5 routes, kinship.page.index at lib/Controller/PageController.php:22"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "1 verb and path or route name is declared more than once. The server keeps one route per name and takes the first that matches a request, so the other one is never reached.",
        "  kinship.page.index: kinship.page.index at appinfo/routes.php:5 routes, kinship.page.index at lib/Controller/PageController.php:22"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "migration-name-length",
      "level": "warn",
      "places": [
        "lib/Migration/Version0005Date20260718000000.php:148 the primary key of kinship_extension_configs, named after the table: 25 characters and the prefix oc_, in Nextcloud 31 to 32"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "1 name in the migrations is longer than the server allows, so it stops the install or the update of the app with an exception. The table names are counted with the default prefix oc_.",
        "  Up to Nextcloud 32 the server checks this only where info.xml lists no database, or lists oci among them.",
        "  lib/Migration/Version0005Date20260718000000.php:148 the primary key of kinship_extension_configs, named after the table: 25 characters and the prefix oc_, in Nextcloud 31 to 32"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ocp-deprecated",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [
        "lib/Controller/PermissionController.php:131 OCP\\IUserManager::search(): deprecated since Nextcloud 31; use searchDisplayName instead"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "1 use in 1 file of the public API that is deprecated in Nextcloud 31 to 34. The text of the tag names the replacement where it has one.",
        "  lib/Controller/PermissionController.php:131 OCP\\IUserManager::search(): deprecated since Nextcloud 31; use searchDisplayName instead"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "job-time-sensitivity",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [
        "lib/Cron/PrivacyThresholdJob.php OCA\\Kinship\\Cron\\PrivacyThresholdJob"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "1 timed job does not say whether it is time sensitive. A job that sets TIME_INSENSITIVE with setTimeSensitivity() is moved to the maintenance window of the server; whether a job is heavy enough for that only its maintainer knows.",
        "  lib/Cron/PrivacyThresholdJob.php OCA\\Kinship\\Cron\\PrivacyThresholdJob"
      ]
    },
